Methods of django-ninja releases scrudful is verified against, whose source
differs from that of the release the test suite installs. Each file
``<release>__<Class>.<method>.txt`` is that method as the release ships it,
copied verbatim (indented as in its class) from its ``ninja`` package, so
that tests/test_ninja_releases.py can check scrudful accepts it.

